    "abstract": "Parts figure for the core processing module rack installation showing the six module slots, the guide rail set, the rail hardware and the rack bonding group.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the core processing module rack installation, including the modules, the guide rail set and the rack bonding hardware.",
      "figure_note": "The six slots are physically identical and are distinguished only by position; the slot map in the maintenance task, not this figure, records which module belongs where. Item 10 covers all three module standards under one part number with different effectivity notes, because the interface is preserved across them. The guide rail set at item 20 carries the integral cooling ducting only from the backplane standard onward and cannot be fitted to a delivered backplane."
    },
